{
  "workflowId": "300000331058606",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_WIS_KANBAN_WORKSPACE_SUPPLIER_PERFORMANCE_ADVISOR",
  "name": "Kanban Supplier Performance",
  "description": "This agent evaluates supplier performance by comparing actual replenishment lead times against planned lead times for items supplied through kanban pull sequences.\n\nIt analyzes kanban card movements to measure the time elapsed between when a card enters In Process status and when it becomes Full, and compares this actual lead time with the planned lead time defined at the pull sequence level. Using this comparison, the agent identifies suppliers whose deliveries are consistently delayed or consistently faster than expected beyond defined tolerance levels.\n\nThe agent helps users understand supplier reliability and volatility, guiding decisions to adjust safety stock buffers, refine lead time parameters in pull sequences, or evaluate alternative suppliers when performance issues persist.\n\nThis agent supports both high-level monitoring of replenishment delays by item and supplier, and drill-down analysis to review individual kanban cards and update lead times to improve supply chain resilience.",
