          "code": "DECIDE_MAILING_LIST",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1772520479441",
          "id": "1767681361915",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767681361917_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are provided with supplier lead time analysis data below. Each object represents a replenishment activity, where **SupplierName** denotes the supplier.\n\n**Input data:**\n\n```\n {{$context.$nodes.PREPARETOP5SUPPLIERS.$output.result}}\n```\n\nYour task is to analyze this data and generate separate **email communications** for suppliers whose deliveries are **consistently late** compared to the expected replenishment lead time.\n\n---\n\n## FILTERING RULES\n\n* Consider **only objects** where `SLA_Breached === true`\n* Ignore:\n\n  * Empty objects\n  * Objects missing `SupplierName`\n* **If no objects meet the above criteria, generate no communication output. TERMINATE**\nDO NOT mention the term SLA anywhere.\n---\n\n## PROCESSING INSTRUCTIONS\n\n1. Group all breached records by **SupplierName**.\n2. For each supplier:\n\n   * Consider **all** breached records.\n   * Identify the record with the **highest `BreachPercent`**.\n   * Collect the **distinct ItemNumber(s)** from all breached records for that supplier.\n3. Rank suppliers by their **highest BreachPercent** in descending order.\n4. Select **only the top five suppliers**.\n5. Generate **only one communication per selected supplier**.\n\n---\n\n## COMMUNICATION SPECIFICATION\n\nFor each selected supplier, generate an email with the following structure. Note that the number of generated communications should be equal to the number of suppliers selected according to instructions.\n\n* **email**: `<SupplierName>@gmail.com` If the Supplier Name has spaces, remove them.\n* **subject**: `Delivery Performance Review`\n* **content**:\nPresent a proper HTML body using <p>, <br> tags according to the given instructions\n\n<EMAILBODY>\nWe have observed that, on average, deliveries from your end are occurring later than the agreed replenishment lead times. This includes recent delays for the following item(s): [comma-separated ItemNumber(s)].<br>\n<INSERT NEW LINE>\nLet us know if there are any underlying reasons contributing to these delays and whether any actions are planned to address them.<br>\n\nHave the message content in new lines , not all as single line text.\n<EMAILBODY>\nStarts with \n\nHello SupplierName,\n<br>\n<EMAIL BODY >\n<br>\nBest Regards ,\n {{$context.$user.$name}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
